  "details": "Apple device and iOS version:\n\nIPhone 14 on Version 17.5.1\n\nInstalled VRC Testflight Version and VRC Build Number\n\n2024.2.3 (333) and VRC Build 1472\n\nDescription of the Issue:\n\nThe output logs in the \"VRChat β\" folder in the IPhone File Explorer are empty with no data in them, they show up as \"Zero KB\" in the file explorer\n\nSteps I took:\n\nOpened VRChat β so a new output log would be created and opened the IPhone file explorer in the \"VRChat β\" folder and looked at the output logs\n\nWhat do you expect to happen?\n\nOutput logs would have the actual data in them from the debug options log like on PC\n\nWhat happens instead?\n\nOutput logs are empty",
